doctype html
html(lang='es')
  head
    meta(charset='UTF-8')
    meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0')
    title Iniciar Sesion - Portal de Empleo UP
    link(rel='preconnect', href='https://fonts.googleapis.com')
    link(rel='preconnect', href='https://fonts.gstatic.com', crossorigin)
    link(href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap', rel='stylesheet')
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200')
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/css/style.css')

    style.
      :root {
        --up-blue: #003876;
        --up-blue-dark: #002147;
        --up-blue-mid: #004a9f;
        --up-gold: #C49A1A;
        --up-gold-light: #e8c44d;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background: #f0f4f8;
        color: #1a2233;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      h1, h2, h3, h4, .display {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
      }

      /* ---- NAV (identical to landing) ---- */
      .nav-portal {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }

      .nav-inner {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        height: 72px;
      }

      .nav-logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-logo-icon {
        background: var(--up-blue);
        color: var(--up-gold);
        border-radius: 10px;
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .nav-logo-title {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--up-blue);
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .nav-logo-sub {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--up-gold);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .nav-link {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #334155;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }

      .nav-link:hover { color: var(--up-gold); }

      .mobile-menu-btn {
        display: none;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--up-blue);
      }

      /* ---- MAIN LAYOUT ---- */
      .login-main {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 3rem 1rem;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      /* Background decoration */
      .login-main::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -120px;
        left: -120px;
        width: 400px;
        height: 400px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,56,118,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .login-main::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -80px;
        right: -80px;
        width: 300px;
        height: 300px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(196,154,26,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      /* ---- LOGIN CARD ---- */
      .login-card {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 48px rgba(0,56,118,0.1), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
        border: 1px solid #e8edf5;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 480px;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .login-card-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--up-blue) 0%, var(--up-blue-dark) 100%);
        padding: 2rem 2.5rem 2.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .login-card-header::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -40px;
        right: -40px;
        width: 160px;
        height: 160px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      }

      .login-card-header::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -60px;
        left: 20px;
        width: 140px;
        height: 140px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(196,154,26,0.07);
      }

      .login-logo-wrap {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .login-logo-bg {
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        border-radius: 18px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      }

      .login-logo-bg .material-symbols-outlined {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        color: var(--up-gold-light);
        font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;
      }

      .login-card-title {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #fff;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      }

      .login-card-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .login-card-body {
        padding: 2rem 2.5rem 2.5rem;
      }

      /* ---- ROLE SELECTOR ---- */
      .role-label {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #374151;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        display: block;
      }

      .role-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .role-option {
        position: relative;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .role-option input[type='radio'] {
        position: absolute;
        opacity: 0;
        width: 0;
        height: 0;
      }

      .role-card {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
        background: #f8fafc;
        transition: all 0.18s;
        cursor: pointer;
        user-select: none;
      }

      .role-card:hover {
        border-color: #bfdbfe;
        background: #eff6ff;
      }

      .role-option input:checked + .role-card {
        border-color: var(--up-blue);
        background: #eff6ff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,56,118,0.08);
      }

      .role-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #e2e8f0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #64748b;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: all 0.18s;
      }

      .role-option input:checked + .role-card .role-icon {
        background: var(--up-blue);
        color: #fff;
      }

      .role-icon .material-symbols-outlined {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;
      }

      .role-name {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #374151;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .role-option input:checked + .role-card .role-name {
        color: var(--up-blue);
      }

      /* ---- FORM FIELDS ---- */
      .form-divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: #f1f5f9;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .field-group {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .field-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }

      .field-label {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #374151;
      }

      .field-input-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .field-input-icon {
        position: absolute;
        left: 13px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 400;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .field-input {
        width: 100%;
        height: 46px;
        padding: 0 14px 0 40px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
        background: #f8fafc;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #1a2233;
        outline: none;
        transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s;
      }

      .field-input:focus {
        border-color: var(--up-blue);
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,56,118,0.08);
      }

      .field-input::placeholder { color: #b0bec5; }

      /* Password toggle */
      .field-toggle {
        position: absolute;
        right: 13px;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: #94a3b8;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        transition: color 0.2s;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .field-toggle:hover { color: var(--up-blue); }

      /* ---- FORGOT ---- */
      .forgot-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .forgot-btn {
        background: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--up-blue);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.2s;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .forgot-btn:hover { color: var(--up-gold); }

      /* ---- SUBMIT ---- */
      .btn-submit {
        width: 100%;
        height: 48px;
        background: var(--up-blue);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,56,118,0.2);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .btn-submit:hover {
        background: var(--up-gold);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(196,154,26,0.3);
      }

      /* ---- DIVIDER ---- */
      .or-divider {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      .or-divider::before,
      .or-divider::after {
        content: '';
        flex: 1;
        height: 1px;
        background: #e2e8f0;
      }

      /* ---- REGISTER LINK ---- */
      .register-link-row {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.83rem;
        color: #64748b;
      }

      .register-link {
        color: var(--up-blue);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
        transition: color 0.2s, gap 0.2s;
      }

      .register-link:hover { color: var(--up-gold); gap: 7px; }

      /* ---- FOOTER ---- */
      .login-footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.2rem;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        background: #fff;
      }

      /* ============================================================
         MODAL DE RECUPERACION DE CONTRASENA
         ============================================================ */
      .modal-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        z-index: 500;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 1rem;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.25s;
      }

      .modal-overlay.active {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: all;
      }

      .modal-box {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 480px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.97);
        transition: transform 0.25s;
      }

      .modal-overlay.active .modal-box {
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }

      .modal-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--up-blue) 0%, var(--up-blue-dark) 100%);
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .modal-header-content { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }

      .modal-header-icon {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        border-radius: 10px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--up-gold-light);
      }

      .modal-title {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .modal-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .modal-close-btn {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        border: none;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        border-radius: 8px;
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .modal-close-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

      .modal-body { padding: 2rem; }

      .modal-intro {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: #64748b;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .recovery-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

      .recovery-step {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        transition: border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .recovery-step:hover { border-color: #bfdbfe; }

      .step-badge {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .step-badge-blue { background: var(--up-blue); color: #fff; }
      .step-badge-gold { background: var(--up-gold); color: #fff; }
      .step-badge-teal { background: #0e7490; color: #fff; }

      .step-content { flex: 1; }

      .step-role {
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--up-gold);
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }

      .step-title-text {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #0f172a;
        margin-bottom: 3px;
      }

      .step-detail {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #64748b;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .modal-footer {
        padding: 1rem 2rem 1.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        background: #fafbfc;
      }

      .modal-contact-icon {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        background: #eff6ff;
        border-radius: 9px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--up-blue);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .modal-contact-text {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #64748b;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .modal-contact-link {
        color: var(--up-blue);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .modal-contact-link:hover { color: var(--up-gold); }

      /* ---- RESPONSIVE ---- */
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .nav-links { display: none; }
        .mobile-menu-btn { display: flex; }
        .login-card-header { padding: 1.5rem; }
        .login-card-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
        .role-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        .modal-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
        .modal-footer { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      }

  //- ============================================================
  //- NAVBAR
  //- ============================================================
  nav.nav-portal
    .nav-inner
      a.nav-logo(href='/')
        .nav-logo-icon
          span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:1.5rem') school
        div
          .nav-logo-title Portal de Empleo UP
          .nav-logo-sub Universidad de Panama

      .nav-links
        a.nav-link(href='/') INICIO
        a.nav-link(href='/requisitos') REQUISITOS PARA REGISTRARSE
        a.nav-link(href='/contacto') CONTACTENOS

      button.mobile-menu-btn(onclick='toggleMenu()' aria-label='Menu')
        span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:1.6rem') menu

  //- ============================================================
  //- MAIN
  //- ============================================================
  main.login-main

    .login-card

      //- Header con gradiente UP
      .login-card-header
        .login-logo-wrap
          .login-logo-bg
            span.material-symbols-outlined school
        h1.login-card-title Portal de Empleo UP
        p.login-card-subtitle Inicia sesion en tu cuenta para continuar

      //- Formulario
      .login-card-body

        //- Selector de tipo de usuario
        span.role-label(style='margin-bottom:0.5rem; display:block') Soy...
        .role-grid

          label.role-option
            input(type='radio' name='estamento' value='estudiante' checked)
            .role-card
              .role-icon
                span.material-symbols-outlined school
              .role-name Estudiante

          label.role-option
            input(type='radio' name='estamento' value='egresado')
            .role-card
              .role-icon
                span.material-symbols-outlined workspace_premium
              .role-name Egresado

          label.role-option
            input(type='radio' name='estamento' value='empresa')
            .role-card
              .role-icon
                span.material-symbols-outlined business
              .role-name Empresa

          label.role-option
            input(type='radio' name='estamento' value='administrativo')
            .role-card
              .role-icon
                span.material-symbols-outlined manage_accounts
              .role-name Administrativo

        .form-divider

        //- Campos
        form(action='/dashboard' method='POST')
          .field-group

            .field-wrap
              label.field-label(for='email') Correo electronico
              .field-input-wrap
                span.field-input-icon.material-symbols-outlined mail
                input#email.field-input(
                  type='email'
                  name='email'
                  placeholder='usuario@up.ac.pa'
                  required
                  autocomplete='email'
                )

            .field-wrap
              label.field-label(for='password') Contrasena
              .field-input-wrap
                span.field-input-icon.material-symbols-outlined lock
                input#password.field-input(
                  type='password'
                  name='password'
                  placeholder='&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;'
                  required
                  autocomplete='current-password'
                  style='padding-right:42px'
                )
                button.field-toggle(type='button' onclick='togglePassword()' aria-label='Mostrar contrasena')
                  span#toggle-icon.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:1.1rem; font-variation-settings:"FILL" 0') visibility

          .forgot-row
            button.forgot-btn(type='button' onclick='openModal()') &iquest;Olvidaste tu contrasena?

          button.btn-submit(type='submit')
            | Entrar
            span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:1.05rem') arrow_forward

          .or-divider Nueva en el portal?

          .register-link-row
            a.register-link(href='/registro')
              | Registrarse como Empresa
              span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:0.95rem') arrow_forward

  //- ============================================================
  //- FOOTER
  //- ============================================================
  footer.login-footer
    | &copy; 2025 Universidad de Panama &mdash; Portal de Empleo. Todos los derechos reservados.

  //- ============================================================
  //- MODAL RECUPERACION DE CONTRASENA
  //- ============================================================
  #modal-password.modal-overlay(role='dialog' aria-modal='true' aria-labelledby='modal-title')
    .modal-box

      .modal-header
        .modal-header-content
          .modal-header-icon
            span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-variation-settings:"FILL" 1; font-size:1.2rem') lock_reset
          div
            h2#modal-title.modal-title Recuperar Contrasena
            p.modal-subtitle Pasos segun tu tipo de usuario
        button.modal-close-btn(onclick='closeModal()' aria-label='Cerrar')
          span.material-symbols-outlined(style='font-size:1.1rem') close

      .modal-body
        p.modal-intro
          | Selecciona tu tipo de usuario a continuacion y sigue las instrucciones para recuperar el acceso a tu cuenta.

        .recovery-steps

          .recovery-step
            .step-badge.step-badge-blue 1
            .step-content
              .step-role Estudiantes y Egresados
              .step-title-text Recuperacion por correo institucional
              p.step-detail
                | Usa tu correo @up.ac.pa. Recibiras un enlace de restablecimiento en tu bandeja de entrada. Revisa tambien la carpeta de spam.

          .recovery-step
            .step-badge.step-badge-gold 2
            .step-content
              .step-role Empresas registradas
              .step-title-text Verificacion por RUC y correo de contacto
              p.step-detail
                | Ingresa el RUC de tu empresa y el correo con el que te registraste. Recibirás las instrucciones para restablecer tu acceso.

          .recovery-step
            .step-badge.step-badge-teal 3
            .step-content
              .step-role Personal Administrativo
              .step-title-text Contacta a la Direccion de Informatica
              p.step-detail
